## Network Topology

To make myself aware of the path a packet has to take — and to prepare for
potential obstacles along the way — I created a simple network topology of my lab environment.

![WiFi-Network Topologie](WiFi-Network.png)

*The topology shows two machines on the same Wi-Fi subnet: the attacker (Kali Linux)
and the victim (Windows 11). All traffic between them passes through the home router.*

| Role     | OS                | Network |
|----------|-------------------|---------|
| Attacker | Kali Linux 2026.2 | Wi-Fi   |
| Victim   | Windows 11 Home   | Wi-Fi   |

